contentText:
It took Taylor Swift &#8216;s nieces some time to see her as Aunt Taylor instead of, well, Taylor Swift.

On the latest episode of New Heights published Wednesday (Sept. 16), Travis Kelce recalled how the family had to &#8220;break [the] habit&#8221; Jason Kelce&#8217;s daughters had of calling the pop star by her full, ultra famous name. “When they got to meet Aunt Tay Tay, they were calling her &#8216;Taylor Swift,'&#8221; Travis said, noting that he thought it was &#8220;adorable.&#8221;

